     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hello all!</div><div><br></div><div>We will have a <span>working</span> <span>group</span>\r\n on Thursday, 02/013 from 10am-12pm in 360 Shields Library (DataLab \r\nclassroom). For the first hour, Ryan will teach the second part of our 3-part \r\nggplot2 tutorial series. I hope to see you there! If you missed the first part, you can find the code we covered as well as a video of the tutorial <a href=\"https://d-rug.github.io/blog/2020/Taylor-Reiter-intro-ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.github.io/blog/2020/Taylor-Reiter-intro-ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465503652000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1gtECufTcSEKdAoo1Lb2Dr\">here</a>. <br></div><div><br></div>I&#39;m including the presentation schedule for the rest of the quarter below. <br clear=\"all\"><div><table dir=\"ltr\" style=\"table-layout:fixed;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;width:0px;border-collapse:collapse;border:medium none\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col width=\"100\"><col width=\"472\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:21px\"><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">02/13/20</td><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(17,85,204);border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\"><a href=\"https://datacarpentry.org/R-ecology-lesson/04-visualization-ggplot2.html#faceting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datacarpentry.org/R-ecology-lesson/04-visualization-ggplot2.html%23faceting&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465503652000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1T7a7mt5kk1O9KyDRqiNJw\">Intro to plotting with ggplot2: faceting and themes</a></td></tr><tr style=\"height:21px\"><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">02/20/20</td><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(17,85,204);border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\"><a href=\"https://datacarpentry.org/R-ecology-lesson/04-visualization-ggplot2.html#customization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datacarpentry.org/R-ecology-lesson/04-visualization-ggplot2.html%23customization&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465503652000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XvGem1h-nhd6Q0yHKY2Kw\">intro to plotting with ggplot2: customization &amp; arranging and exporting </a></td></tr><tr style=\"height:21px\"><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">02/27/20</td><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">TBD</td></tr><tr style=\"height:21px\"><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">03/05/20</td><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">TBD</td></tr><tr style=\"height:21px\"><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">03/12/20</td><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">TBD</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Taylor<br></div><div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Taylor Reiter</div><div>PhD Candidate<br></div><div>Food Science Graduate Group</div><div>Lab for Data Intensive Biology</div>University of California, Davis</div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
